Package: linux-image-5.10.264-lenovo-tb320fc
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux kernel for Lenovo Legion Tab 2023
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Lenovo Legion Tab 2023 device.
 .
 Note: This package only ships the kernel image and modules, you should probably
 look at the linux-bootimage-5.10.264-lenovo-tb320fc package for a bootimage suitable
 for Android boot loaders.

