         linux-image-5.10.264-lenovo-tb320fc (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Linux kernel for Lenovo Legion Tab 2023 - Android Boot Image
 This package contains the Linux kernel for the Lenovo Legion Tab 2023 device.
 .
 Note: This package ships an Android Boot Image bundled with Halium's
 initramfs.

